  "_pacingNote": "Unlock costs tuned by tools/studio/run-sim.ts against a 1500-turn campaign at skill 0.55. Measured pacing after the prep-item serve fix (v5 -> v6): espetinho_rua 47, trailer 109, bairro 185->230 (cost 12k->15k), premium 377->460 (55k->67k), festival 842->1000 (150k->178k), rede 1228->1590 (3.25M->4.2M). Costs were raised because fixing two real bugs (vinagrete was unservable, and prep items respawned every tick) removed a ~10% customer leak that had been artificially slowing progression."
